package components

// Avatar renders one person's circular avatar image, given the PCO
// Attributes.Avatar URL PCO already returns on every person - a real
// uploaded photo, or PCO's own generated colored-initials placeholder if
// they have none, with no local initials/color logic needed on this side.
// Renders nothing when url is "" (a failed batched person lookup - see
// personLookupMapForIDs - or a search result whose own PCO response
// somehow omitted it), the same graceful-degradation a missing name falls
// back to a raw id instead of erroring. alt is deliberately "" - every call
// site renders the person's name as visible text right next to this image,
// so a screen reader announcing it too would just repeat the name.
templ Avatar(url string) {
	if url != "" {
		<img class="avatar" src={ url } alt="" loading="lazy"/>
	}
}
